---
source: crates/onequery-cli/src/cli/../cli_tests.rs
expression: "rendered_display(&[\"onequery\"])"
---
OneQuery CLI

Usage: onequery [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  auth     Manage authentication and stored sessions
  backup   Create a self-host backup archive from the current runtime state
  config   Inspect and persist local CLI config values
  org      Inspect org access and select the active org
  source   Inspect sources available to the active org
  query    Execute or validate source queries
  restore  Restore a self-host backup archive into the runtime directories
  gateway  Run the self-host gateway in foreground by default or manage the background lifecycle
  upgrade  Upgrade this published CLI installation in place
  web      Open the OneQuery dashboard in browser
  api      Describe or execute a connected source API
  explain  Explain a stable CLI error code
  doctor   Inspect local CLI state and diagnostics
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version

Global Options:
      --org <ORG_SLUG>           Override the active org for this invocation
  -c, --config <KEY=VALUE>       Apply a raw config override for this invocation using `key=value`
      --request-id <REQUEST_ID>  Attach a caller-supplied request ID to outbound API requests
      --timeout <SECONDS>        Override the request timeout in seconds for this invocation
      --json                     Emit machine-readable JSON output
      --text                     Emit human-readable text output
      --verbose                  Emit workflow progress and retry tracing to stderr

Support:
  onequery doctor report --last     Create a redacted diagnostic report
  onequery explain <code>           Explain a stable error code
